msgid ""
"Open the Diagnostics tab (or click \"Diagnose\" in the Kledo Status tab or "
"on the order page)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:397
msgid "Choose the order from the list — orders with a problem in Kledo are at the top, and you can search by number, customer name or email, or type an order number — then click \"Run diagnosis\". Eight checks run one by one: ✔ passed, ⚠ warning, ✖ problem. Open \"Details\" on any of them to see more."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:398
msgid "Read \"Likely cause\" and \"What to do\" at the end, and follow it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:399
msgid "To try again at once, tick \"Also resend to Kledo and record what happens\" before running. Only what Kledo does not have yet is resent."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:400
