msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:404
msgid "The report never contains your API key, and customer details are partly hidden unless you choose otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:407
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:452
msgid "Open the Diagnostics tab"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:412
msgid "Automatic retries and scheduled tasks"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:414
msgid "A failed send is retried by itself: after about 5 minutes, then less and less often up to every 8 hours, for up to two days."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:415
msgid "Data that Kledo rejected is not retried, because it would be rejected again. Fix the data, then resend."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:416
msgid "Retries, checks and the Sync tab run on WordPress scheduled tasks (WP-Cron). If your host blocks them, the work also runs when an administrator opens wp-admin, but a real cron job is better — ask your hosting provider."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:417
msgid "Everything the plugin does is written to WooCommerce › Status › Logs, source \"wc-kledo\", and important results to the order notes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:450
msgid "An order is not in Kledo. What should I do?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:451
msgid "Run a diagnosis for it in the Diagnostics tab. It tells you the likely cause and what to do, and can resend it. If that does not help, send the report to Kledo."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:456
msgid "What does \"Failed in Kledo\" mean?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:457
msgid "Kledo accepted the order but never created it — the problem happened inside Kledo. It is not resent by itself, so a slow Kledo cannot cause duplicates. Resend it; if it fails again, run a diagnosis and send the report to Kledo."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:461
msgid "An order has been \"Waiting for Kledo\" for a long time. Is that normal?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:462
msgid "Usually it turns into \"In Kledo\" within minutes. The plugin keeps checking for about 6 hours; if it never appears, the status becomes \"Failed in Kledo\". You can also click \"Check status\" to ask right away."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:466
msgid "Can an order be created twice in Kledo?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:467
msgid "The plugin avoids it: bulk actions, the Sync tab and the diagnosis only send what Kledo does not have yet, and Kledo recognises an order it already has by its WooCommerce order number. Only \"Re-send\" on the order page sends again on purpose. A transaction you created by hand in Kledo with a different number is not recognised."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:471
msgid "Does the plugin send my old orders by itself after I install or update it?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:472
msgid "No. It only counts the orders of the last 30 days that are not in Kledo and shows a message. Nothing is sent until you press \"Process gradually\" in the Sync tab, or switch on \"Send Automatically Every Day\"."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:477
msgid "I changed an order straight to Completed. Is the sales order still created?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:478
msgid "Yes, by default: the sales order is created first, and the invoice follows once the sales order is in Kledo. To send only the invoice for such orders, turn off \"Create Sales Order First When an Order Skips Processing\" in the Invoice tab."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:483
msgid "Why is an invoice \"Waiting for sales order\"?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:484
msgid "With \"Link Invoice to Sales Order\" on, the invoice is only sent once its sales order exists in Kledo, so the two can be linked. It is sent by itself as soon as the sales order is there."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:488
msgid "I edited, cancelled or refunded an order after it was sent. Does Kledo update?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:489
msgid "No. The plugin only creates transactions when an order becomes Processing or Completed; it does not change or delete them afterwards. Adjust the transaction in Kledo yourself."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:493
msgid "What data is sent to Kledo?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:494
msgid "The customer's name, email, phone and address; the order number and date; each product's name, SKU, description, quantity, price and photo link; shipping cost, discount and whether tax applies; the warehouse, tags and payment settings you chose; and shipment tracking when WooCommerce Shipment Tracking is used."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:498
msgid "How are my products matched in Kledo?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:499
msgid "Each product is sent with its name and SKU. Give every product a SKU so Kledo can recognise it. Products deleted from the store cannot be sent; the diagnosis warns about missing SKUs and deleted products."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:503
msgid "My API key is about to expire. What now?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:504
msgid "Click \"Create a new API key in Kledo\" in the message or on the Configure tab, create the key, paste it into \"API Key\" and click \"Save changes\". Do it before the expiry date; after it, nothing reaches Kledo until a new key is saved."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:512
msgid "The plugin says Kledo refuses my API key."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:513
msgid "The key has expired or was replaced, or the account behind it lost access to the company. Create a new key while logged in to the right company in Kledo, and save it in the Configure tab."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:517
msgid "How do I stop sending to Kledo for a while?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:518
msgid "Untick \"Enable Integration\" in the Configure tab. Orders that change status meanwhile are not sent; send them later from the Sync tab."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:522
msgid "What happens if I deactivate or delete the plugin?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:523
msgid "Deactivating stops sending and pauses a running sync; your settings and history stay, and everything continues when you activate it again. Transactions already in Kledo are never removed."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:527
msgid "Retries never seem to happen."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:528
msgid "WordPress scheduled tasks (WP-Cron) are probably not running on your host. The diagnosis checks this (\"Queues and scheduled tasks\"). Ask your hosting provider to enable WP-Cron or a real cron job."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:532
msgid "Where can I see what the plugin did?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:533
msgid ""
"In the order notes of each order, in the Kledo Status tab, and in "
"WooCommerce › Status › Logs (source \"wc-kledo\"; \"wc-kledo-debug\" while "
"recording for 24 hours)."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:534
msgid "Open the logs"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:538
msgid "Is there a faster way to open these tabs?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-help.php:539
msgid "Yes. On WordPress 6.9 and later, press Ctrl+K (Cmd+K on a Mac) anywhere in wp-admin and type \"kledo\". The Plugins screen also has a \"Settings\" link under Kledo."
msgstr ""

